    "Near-floor dye sensitivity (z99 \u2265 90% of the configured depth): Fixed reference: z99=49.2 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 13.9 s; Measured wave history: z99=49.4 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 13.2 s; Wind + parent loss: z99=49.3 mm of H=50 mm at elapsed 13.9 s. These depths may depend on the bottom boundary; further deepening needs a domain-depth sensitivity check.",
    "Grid and perturbation sensitivity \u2014 Fixed reference at matched elapsed 2.7 s: coarse/refined differences are 21.2% for dye-centroid depth and 37.7% for z99, relative to the refined values. Both the grid and perturbation realization differ; this is a sensitivity comparison, not a convergence result.",
    "Grid and perturbation sensitivity \u2014 Wind + parent loss at matched elapsed 1.06 s: coarse/refined differences are 67.6% for dye-centroid depth and 71.2% for z99, relative to the refined values. Both the grid and perturbation realization differ; this is a sensitivity comparison, not a convergence result."
